# Maker Studio — .gitignore for your game project
# Copy this file to your project root (next to Game.exe) and rename it to `.gitignore`.
# It excludes only what Maker Studio generates on its own.

# Local editor state: usage stats, session lock, hot-reload signal, dock layout.
Plugins/MakerStudio/003_Editor/.project-stats.json
Plugins/MakerStudio/003_Editor/.editor-session.lock
Plugins/MakerStudio/003_Editor/.live-reload
Plugins/MakerStudio/003_Editor/ms-editor-config.json

# Rolling map backups written before every save — git is your real history.
Data/map-backups/
